{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50504","headline":"敬和吏部韦郎中庭前朱槿之作 · 宋之问","name":"敬和吏部韦郎中庭前朱槿之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日给当轮满，星郎伏奏旋。\n犹纡起草思，更有落花篇。\n气与香衣杂，光侵画壁然。\n徒闻赋君子，无以和神仙。\n（此诗见《分门纂类唐歌诗》残本第六册《草木虫鱼类》卷五。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50504.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50504","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}